<title>USA: Good Guys Q1 same store sales down 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Good Guys Q1 same store sales down 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO</dateline>
<text>
<p>Good Guys Inc Wednesday said sales for its first fiscal quarter ended December 31, 1996 fell seven percent to $286.6 million from $306.7 million in the first quarter of fiscal 1996, and comparable store sales for the quarter fell 12 percent.</p>
</text>
